WEBVTT

00:00:01.115 --> 00:00:04.312
Unreeled is an open-source
app for Instagram.

00:00:04.352 --> 00:00:06.570
Here's how it keeps your account private.

00:00:07.225 --> 00:00:09.848
You log in on Instagram's own page.

00:00:09.888 --> 00:00:13.100
Unreeled never reads or
stores your password.

00:00:13.715 --> 00:00:16.650
After that, your phone talks
straight to Instagram.

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:20.980
Nothing you see or send passes
through a server of ours.

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:24.182
No analytics, no tracking, no ads.

00:00:24.222 --> 00:00:26.670
Unreeled collects nothing about you.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:31.420
It downloads one thing: a short
list that keeps it working,

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:34.730
signed by the project so
nobody else can change it.

00:00:35.375 --> 00:00:39.050
Log out, and everything it
saved on your phone is deleted.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:42.125
Notifications are optional.

00:00:42.165 --> 00:00:46.363
They do pass through a server, Unreeled's
relay, but it can't read them.

00:00:46.403 --> 00:00:47.550
Here's why.

00:00:48.165 --> 00:00:52.413
Your phone makes a pair of keys, and
the private key never leaves it.

00:00:52.453 --> 00:00:57.590
Instagram gets the public key and a
push address, just as a browser would.

00:00:58.205 --> 00:01:01.690
Instagram encrypts each
notification for your phone.

00:01:01.730 --> 00:01:06.640
It travels through Mozilla's push
service, Unreeled's relay, and Apple's.

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:08.303
None of them has the key.

00:01:08.343 --> 00:01:10.280
Only your phone can read it.

00:01:11.285 --> 00:01:15.470
The relay keeps a random ID,
your phone's address at Apple,

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:18.820
the push address, and when
your phone was last seen.

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:22.495
It sees when a notification
passes, and its size.

00:01:22.535 --> 00:01:25.360
Never what it says, or
whose account it is.

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:28.790
Turn notifications off, or log out,

00:01:28.830 --> 00:01:32.340
and the keys are deleted and
the relay forgets your phone.

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:37.740
The app and the relay are open source,
so anyone can check all of this.

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:41.415
One caution: Unreeled is unofficial,

00:01:41.455 --> 00:01:44.803
and Instagram could restrict
an account that uses it.

00:01:44.843 --> 00:01:48.040
The details are at unreeled.app.
